{\plain {\b0 \fs20 \i0 In Mathcad n is termed
 a }{\b \i0 \fs20 range variable}{\b0 \fs20 
\i0 . We fit N to the problem and the computer.
 We define an }{\b \fs20 \i0 array}{\fs20 
\b0 \i0  that represents the digital signal.
 E.g., an }{\b \fs20 \i0 exponential }{\b 
\fs20 \i0 sequence}{\fs20 \b0 \i0  could
 be entered this way.}}
}
