q}{+}{\f2 p}{/2. Also, as the }{\b complex
 exponential}{ exp(i(}{\f2 w}{n+}{\f2 q}{))
 = cos}{(}{\f2 w}{n+}{\f2 q}{)+isin}{(}{\f2 
w}{n+}{\f2 q}{), these comments on periodicity
 apply to it. }{If the sinusoidal sequence
 of frequency }{\f2 w}{ is a sample sequence
 obtained from a sinusoidal analog signal
 of frequency }{\f2 n}{, then we have the
 relation}}
}
