{\plain {In digital signal processing we
 are often concerned with multiple data 
sequences, or }{\b records}{. It is convenient
 and conventional to store these records
 as columns in a matrix array. Given such
 an array, an individual record can be accessed
 as a specific column. Mathcad has a simple
 way to do this. We illustrate this with
 a simple example composed of M records 
of length N of a pulse with M different 
delays.}}
}
