{\f2\fnil Symbol;}
{\f3\fnil CG Times;}
}
{\plain {I}{t is often necessary in digital
 signal processing}{ to form subsequences,
 or }{\b \i0 blocks}{\b , }{\b0 of}{ a sequence.
 E.g.,}{ when processing long sequences,
 it may not be possible to load into the
 computer the entire sequence.}{ Then operations
 may be performed on the individual blocks,
 and the processed blocks may be reassembled
 in a prescribed manner to form a new, or
 processed, long sequence. (See }{\ul \b 
Sec. 5}{.)}}
}
.ATT
.STATUS Go to Section 5
.GOTO 5_bk.mcd
.ATT_END
