{\plain {\fs24 \f1 \b \ulnone Example 1.5
 ______________________________________}{\f0 
  \par We give a simple example of forming
 and reassembling }{\f0 \i0 blocks}{\f0 
 of a     given sequence. We define a sinusoidal
 sequence of length N and form J disjunct
 blocks from it, each labeled by an index
 j and each of length M=N/J. These subsequences
 then form the columns of an M by N matrix
 sb.}}
}
