{\f1\fnil Times New Roman;}
{\f2\fnil Symbol;}
{\f3\fnil CG Times;}
}
{\plain {\f0 \b0 \i0 \f0 \b0 \i0 (d) We 
wish to implement a receiver to estimate
 each binary symbol from the "signal plus
 noise sequence". The receiver will do three
 operations.     }}
}
.TXT 7 4 324 0
Cg a46.500000,46.125000,199
{\rtf1\ansi \deff0
{\fonttbl
{\f0\fnil Arial;}
{\f1\fnil Times New Roman;}
{\f2\fnil Symbol;}
{\f3\fnil CG Times;}
}
{\plain {\f0 \b0 \i0 \f0 \b0 \i0 (i)  The
 first operation is sampling the received
 analog waveform: implement this. (You will
 have to choose the sample period. You should
 have several samples per pulse.)}}
}
.TXT 7 3 325 0
Cg a42.125000,43.250000,244
{\rtf1\ansi \deff0
{\fonttbl
{\f0\fnil Arial;}
